influenced by choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Plays like a gripping episode of television, coming in at 30 minutes to an hour of gameplay for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique, dark and grunge inspired art style and soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Consequential choices with four different, yet substantial endings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thought-provoking scenarios that will provoke philosophical questions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Help Hana pierce the veil of her past.</i></strong> And from there, find out whether some things are better left in the past or whether we have a duty to make right on our past. You choose the path.</p>",
